  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.17: Add the versioned EffortHours Codex companion skill with explicit print, install, and stale-check commands; emit privacy-safe actionable today-workflow failures; and reduce GitHub-assisted discovery overhead through bounded batching, complete fallbacks, metadata caching, and provider-process telemetry. Refresh the public README with current today, portfolio, and Codex workflows. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.17/CHANGELOG.md",
